# The edge of the world below Upper Market holds (city phase 10; the city sweep's twin-peaks-lot-void):
# the physics sweep's drop there, rolling and ollieing west off the Twin Peaks lots toward the region's
# edge, ends against the boundary wall, which now spans the ground really beside it (8 m over the
# highest surface, 7 m over any lot within 12 m) instead of standing on the street grade.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -1345 -540 97.48 262
hold up 0..60
hold up+left+ollie+grind 60..167
hold up+revert 167..258
hold up+revert 258..295
hold up+walk 295..334
hold up+ollie+revert+walk 334..381
hold up+left 381..406
hold up+ollie+grab+slide 451..490
hold up+revert 490..535
hold right+revert 535..576
hold up 576..662
hold grind 662..752
hold down+left 752..781
hold up+grind 781..869
hold up+right 869..936
hold up 936..1001
hold revert 1001..1013
run 1015
expect skater.pos.z > 80 at end
expect skater.pos.x > -1365 at end
